[Event "Baker Bridge - DONT"]
[Site ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "1"]
[Dealer "E"]
[Vulnerable "None"]
[Deal "E:A2.KQ83.Q65.AJ94 T7.AJ9742.A82.KQ K5.T.KJT73.87653 QJ98643.65.94.T2"]
[Declarer "N"]
[Contract "2S"]
[Result ""]
[Auction "E"]
1NT X pass 2S pass pass pass
[BCFlags "1f"]
[RotationNote "Board 1, chOption: N, chBasis: S, basisKind:Declarer, nOption:0, nBasis: 2, nRot: 2, useStandardVul: true"]
[VersionToken "a14ec074824365e37e4eaca260556fd856056f558e3eff65aa980c7414133dc6"]
[Category "Competitive Bidding"]
[Difficulty "intermediate"]
[SkillPath "competitive_bidding/dont"]
[Student "S"]
{Partner's double asks you to bid 2\C as a relay bid so he can name his suit.

But you don't want him to bid his 6-card suit, your hand is useless unless \Ss are trumps. So ignore the relay request and bid 2\S. Everybody passes.}
[Play "E"]
HK

[Event ""]
[Site ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "2"]
[Dealer "S"]
[Vulnerable "NS"]
[Deal "S:KQ3.A54.A94.K832 AJ97.J73.KQ5.QJ4 T8652.T.JT72.A96 4.KQ9862.863.T75"]
[Declarer "E"]
[Contract "2H"]
[Result ""]
[Auction "S"]
1NT pass pass X pass 2C pass 2H pass pass pass
[BCFlags "1f"]
[RotationNote "Board 2, chOption: E, chBasis: S, basisKind:Declarer, nOption:1, nBasis: 2, nRot: 3, useStandardVul: true"]
[VersionToken "f4f7497daf69562b96f4a1857e5dbc370acc316d4f608e767e3eed522619e4fd"]
[Category "Competitive Bidding"]
[Difficulty "intermediate"]
[SkillPath "competitive_bidding/dont"]
[Student "S"]
{In the balancing seat it is distribution that counts, not point count. With a 6-card Major suit and a singleton you should not let them play 1NT. Youdouble.

Partner makes the relay bid of 2\C.  

You bid your suit, 2\H, and everybody passes. Notice that partner had a decent hand, but could not bid over 1NT in the immediate seat.}
[Play "S"]
SK

[Event ""]
[Site ""]
[Date ""]
[Board "3"]
[Dealer "E"]
[Vulnerable "None"]
[Deal "E:Q6.KQ9.AJT.AT742 A873.J852.Q964.Q JT954.AT74.K82.8 K2.63.753.KJ9653"]
[Declarer "S"]
[Contract "2C"]
[Result ""]
[Auction "E"]
1NT pass pass X pass 2C pass pass pass
[BCFlags "1f"]
[RotationNote "Board 3, chOption: S, chBasis: S, basisKind:Declarer, nOption:2, nBasis: 2, nRot: 0, useStandardVul: true"]
[VersionToken "2e53dd53385cff309b8751764e410976e94f3bbac423aaa5df2ecb65f687892c"]
[Category "Competitive Bidding"]
[Difficulty "intermediate"]
[SkillPath "competitive_bidding/dont"]
[Student "S"]
{You don't have a 6-card suit, nor do you have a 5-4 pair of suits. So even with a singleton you don't want to use DONT here. So you pass.

Partner makes a DONT double in the balancing seat.  

Right now you probably have a premonition about what is going to happen next. But there really is nothing you can say other than 2\C.

Your premonition came true. Partner passes and you are left playing 2\C with a singleton. Nobody promised that DONT would always get you to a good contract.}
[Play "W"]
C8

[Event ""]
[Site ""]
