[Dealer "N"]
[Vulnerable "All"]
[Deal "N:A96.A965.AQ.QT75 85.82.T96.AKJ983 KQT732..KJ8432.4 J4.KQJT743.75.62"]
[Declarer "W"]
[Contract "2H"]
[Result ""]
[Auction "N"]
1NT X pass 2H pass pass pass
[BCFlags "1f"]
[RotationNote "Board 4, chOption: W, chBasis: N, basisKind:Declarer, nOption:3, nBasis: 0, nRot: 3, useStandardVul: true"]
[VersionToken "57aa7c03853542ad44f5fde88701491f96d6d580d456bdb6cd9c2b1cf7a91efb"]
[Category "Competitive Bidding"]
[Difficulty "intermediate"]
[SkillPath "competitive_bidding/dont"]
[Student "S"]
{You only have 8 HCP but with such a good 6-card suit you should interfere with a DONT bid. You double and partner surprises you by saying 2\H.

There is a reason partner didn't say 2\C (which you were going to pass). And the reason is that he figures you will be better off in his \Hs. Since you trust your partner you pass.}
[Play "N"]
H5

